  <Text in="@enterBriefingRoom" wait="200" text="2/13
However, we have no time to
celebrate our small victory" showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" restart="false" cx="60.55555555555556" cz="98.68055555555557" r="2.7777777777777786" />
  <Text in="@enterBriefingRoom" wait="400" text="3/13
We have just found out that our 
codes have been cracked" showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" restart="false" cx="60.55555555555556" cz="98.68055555555557" r="2.7777777777777786" />
  <Text in="@enterBriefingRoom" wait="600" text="4/13
This leads us to believe that 
OutLand Base's current mission
will be met with an ambush" showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" restart="false" cx="60.55555555555556" cz="98.68055555555557" r="2.7777777777777786" />
  <Text in="@enterBriefingRoom" wait="800" text="5/13
Their mission to attack the RHC
main power plant starts shortly" showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" restart="false" cx="60.55555555555556" cz="98.68055555555557" r="2.7777777777777786" />
  <Text in="@enterBriefingRoom" wait="1000" text="6/13
To make sure OutLand Base 
receives the warning correctly we 
need you to deliver it in person" showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" restart="false" cx="60.55555555555556" cz="98.68055555555557" r="2.7777777777777786" />
  <Text in="@enterBriefingRoom" wait="1200" text="7/13
We have only minutes to deliver 
the warning so I'll be quick" showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" restart="false" cx="60.55555555555556" cz="98.68055555555557" r="2.7777777777777786" />
  <Text in="@enterBriefingRoom" wait="1400" text="8/13
We can't risk flying through 
any RHC air defences so you
will be using this Ice Speeder" showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" restart="false" cx="60.55555555555556" cz="98.68055555555557" r="2.7777777777777786" />
  <Text in="@enterBriefingRoom" wait="1600" text="9/13
As you can see by the hologram
image it looks very fast and agile.
It is !" showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" restart="false" cx="60.55555555555556" cz="98.68055555555557" r="2.7777777777777786" />
  <Text in="@enterBriefingRoom" wait="1800" text="10/13
Also, it's auto pilot will take to
the start of the path.  After 
that you are on your own" showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" restart="false" cx="60.55555555555556" cz="98.68055555555557" r="2.7777777777777786" />
  <Text in="@enterBriefingRoom" wait="2000" text="11/13
Just remember that one wrong 
turn off the path and a fall to 
your death is certain" showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" restart="false" cx="60.55555555555556" cz="98.68055555555557" r="2.7777777777777786" />
  <Text in="@enterBriefingRoom" wait="2200" text="12/13
Here is a Hologram of the path. 
You will enter on the lower part
and note the elevation changes" showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" restart="false" cx="60.55555555555556" cz="98.68055555555557" r="2.7777777777777786" />
  <Text in="@enterBriefingRoom" wait="2400" text="13/13
Enter the teleporter to see Gen. Su 
He will give you more detail in 
the Hanger -- Good Luck" showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" restart="false" cx="60.55555555555556" cz="98.68055555555557" r="2.7777777777777786" />
