  <Text in="@stopTele" wait="32" text="1/6
I'll be brief, but there are
a few things you need to know
before you go" showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" restart="false" cx="115.625" cz="186.80555555555554" r="1.4583333333333357" />
  <Text in="@stopTele" wait="200" text="2/6
First there are several jumps 
that you need to make in 
order to reach OutLand Base" showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" restart="false" cx="115.625" cz="186.80555555555554" r="1.4583333333333357" />
  <Text in="@stopTele" wait="400" text="3/6
Your Ice Speeder has built 
in sensors to activate the jumping
mechanism to make the jumps" showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" restart="false" cx="115.625" cz="186.80555555555554" r="1.4583333333333357" />
  <Text in="@stopTele" wait="600" text="4/6
However, once activated the 
recharge time is about 4 seconds." showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" restart="false" cx="115.625" cz="186.80555555555554" r="1.4583333333333357" />
  <Text in="@stopTele" wait="800" text="5/6 
Basically, hit the jumps the
first time in order to complete 
the mission in time." showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" restart="false" cx="115.625" cz="186.80555555555554" r="1.4583333333333357" />
  <Text in="@stopTele" wait="1000" text="6/6
Time is critical so enter your Ice
Speeder to start your mission.
Good Luck" showEveryone="true" align="centerAlign" restart="false" cx="115.625" cz="186.80555555555554" r="1.4583333333333357" />
